:: VehVeh Schooling (OLD second time)


The two of you talked briefly about her education in Apesai before but got lost in the weeds before getting to anything of substance.
<br>
["Oh that's right, my capstone research!"]<VehVehLine| Veh-Veh lights up, but just as quickly, the light fades. ["I... I shouldn't be talking about plans that are going nowhere."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
