(set: $stuff's VehVehOpinionMod to it + 3)
(show:?theKesh)
](magicTheory|

<!--onlySuperstition-->
[
["So everyone says, but what if it //isn't// mere corruption? What if the magi were //made// to turn against their own homeland? What is known now might very well turn into falsehoods in the future. Pray that it doesn't but if it does..."]<VehVehLine| Veh-Veh sighs.` `
(set: $stuff's VehVehOpinionMod to it - 1)
(show:?theKesh)
