<!--badIdea-->
[
It will attract the wrong kind of attention, and her career has barely even started.
<br>
["I //know// it is. That's why I thought better of telling you. But then, I changed my mind. Foolish me. I understand that there is a non-zero chance that I might have to explain this to an Interior officer, and I've already prepared my case,"]<VehVehLine| Veh-Veh stops to take a gasp of air.` `
(show:?theKesh)
(set: $stuff's VehVehOpinionMod to it - 5)
](badIdea|

<!--theKesh-->
[["If it turns out that the Charlatan wasn't just a one-off event, and some other actor - like //Kesh//, for example - figures this out before we do, then who knows how many more Charlatan's Rebellions we will see springing up all over the Seven Provinces.
<br>
"Unlike us, the Keshans have no taboo against brainwashing. They won't just stop at our magi either. Why would they? The serpent cultists indoctrinate their children from the womb. If I am wrong, then it is only time wasted. But if I'm right..."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
The shadow of the Kesh Empire looms over northern Askava, and their serpentine sheddings still dot the province's landscape, as far south as Apesai.
<br>
Historical revisionism, alleged forbidden magic, and now //politics//. It is quickly becoming too heady for you.
<br>
