<!--preDone: Transitions to a special (end) passage because there needs to be an opinion impact (based on $stuff's VehVehOpinionMod), and the standard function for topic lists cannot do this-->
[
<!--initialize various temp vars that affect the ending link-->
(set: _willMod to false)
(set: _endSchoolingLink to "You kept up with her reasonably well.")
(set: _VehVehOpinionModText to "You received her ideas exactly how she thought you would.")
(if: $stuff's VehVehOpinionMod is not 0)[
	(set: _willMod to true)
	(if: $stuff's VehVehOpinionMod > 0)[
		(set: _endSchoolingLink to "There is a hint of a smile on Veh-Veh's lips, though she's trying to not seem so pleased with herself.")
		(set: _VehVehOpinionModText to "She is glad that you were fairly receptive of her research topic... to a point.")
	]
	(else:)[
		(set: _endSchoolingLink to "Is she... sulking? You sure hope she isn't.")
		(set: _VehVehOpinionModText to "Sharing one's ideas is a vulnerable thing. You weren't too nice about it.")
	]
]

Veh-Veh is shifting from one foot to another. She obviously has much more to say, but not today.
<br>
---

(link: _endSchoolingLink)[
	<!--registers all "talked" keys-->
     ($funcTalked:)
     <!--put the crafting topic on cooldown-->
     ($funcAddStoryletCooldown: (passage:)'s name)
	 <!--modify opinion-->
	(if: _willMod)[($funcOpinionGainLoss: "VehVeh", $stuff's VehVehOpinionMod, _VehVehOpinionModText)]
	<!--intensive conversation always drains her (only for this 2nd round)-->
	(set: $char's VehVeh's energy's 1st to 0)
	<!--clear $stuff-->
	(move: $stuff's VehVehOpinionMod into _trash)
	<!--goto end passage-->
	(goto: "VehVeh Schooling (End)")
]
](preDone|